            <ArticleTitle>[Clinico-radiological study of the centers of instantaneous rotation of the lumbar spine].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>405-14</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The author, after a description of CIR's modality of calculus and its mathematical principles, underlines application of such method in diagnosis of lumbar-sacral pathology. A new spine's conception springs from this study: the &quot;motor segment&quot; with its functional and anatomical aspects. This interpretation gives us a new study's method of the lumbar-sacral dynamic and its pathology.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
